      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight, feeling like you are betraying something that is deeply significant to your family. That quiet disappointment you perceive is probably a reflection of their own hopes, and that doesn't make your worth any less. You are not the rot; you are a person navigating a very difficult and painful situation. Please know that your feeling of being broken is a temporary state, not a permanent definition of who you are.",
