    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not temporary. it's fundamental. no matter what i do, the shadow is always there. i feel like the more i try to fix things, the more i just expose the cracks. wouldn't it be easier if the stain was just... gone? if i wasn't the thing dragging the name down through the dirt?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
